  "notes": "{連|つら}ねる means to arrange things in a sequence or to list items one after another.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive)\n- Pair: ⟦{連|つら}なる→連なる：14449_tsuranaru⟧ (intransitive, to form a line)\n\nASPECT (ている):\n{連|つら}ねて⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧ indicates a continuing arrangement or that items remain listed.\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ⟦{言葉|ことば}→言葉：02880_kotoba⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{連|つら}ねる: to string words together\n- ⟦{名前|なまえ}→名前：02234_namae⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{連|つら}ねる: to list names\n- ⟦{理由|りゆう}→理由：01102_riyuu⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{連|つら}ねる: to list reasons\n- ⟦{文句|もんく}→文句：03636_monku⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{連|つら}ねる: to complain at length\n\nUSAGE:\nOften used in written or formal contexts.",
